{"id": "1725", "type": "page", "slug": "healing-our-world-magazine", "path": "learning-centre/healing-our-world-magazine", "title": "Healing our World Magazine", "date": "2025-04-15 10:20:47", "modified": "2026-08-25 18:30:36", "excerpt": "", "content": "<h6><strong>Hippocrates Wellness </strong>TripAdvisor Rating</h6>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"150\" height=\"47\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/tripadvisor.png\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>The Healing our World magazine</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>If you want to stay abreast of what’s happening at Hippocrates and with important issues that affect our world, we invite you to stay in touch through our quarterly magazine - Healing Our World. Hippocrates Wellness’s quarterly magazine is full of stories and resources.</p>Subscribe to the magazine (digital or printed) below.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Recent Episodes\n</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Please complete this form to request your FREE digital subscription to the Hippocrates magazine. The magazine is published each quarter and you will be emailed the link to access the digital copy.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Prefer a printed copy?</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://./the-campus-facilities/become-organic-salon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRequest a printed copy\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Hippocrates Wellness is committed to educating the world to ensure a healthier future for both you and the planet.</p><a href=\"/learning-centre/healing-our-world-magazine/volume-45-issue-1/\"><picture><source srcset=\"/media/ziem43ec/cover.jpg?anchor=